Host 10.30.8.37/24. Conventional IPv4 LAN: reserve network and broadcast addresses. Compute its network CIDR, broadcast, first and last usable address, usable host count, and whether 10.30.9.0 is in this subnet.

Required output schema (type descriptions, not answer values): {"network":"CIDR string","broadcast":"IPv4 string","first":"IPv4 string","last":"IPv4 string","hosts":"integer","next_in_subnet":"boolean"}

